 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** Linear with respect to the number of samples for rotation and sign balancing [S1, unofficial][S2]. Object insertion adds rendering overhead proportional to the number of inserted objects [S3].
-*   **Memory Complexity:** Increases the dataset size by a factor of 2 due to negative sample generation in SDDF augmentation [S2].
